{"root":"cerewet","ipa":"/tʃərəwɛt/","core":"形容人爱唠叨、多嘴、挑剔或吹毛求疵。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃərəwɛt/","zh":"爱唠叨的，多嘴的，挑剔的","phrases":[{"t":"jangan cerewet","zh":"别唠叨了"},{"t":"orang yang cerewet","zh":"爱唠叨的人"},{"t":"sangat cerewet","zh":"非常多嘴"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia sangat cerewet soal makanan.","zh":"他对食物非常挑剔。"},{"t":"Ibu tidak suka kalau anaknya cerewet.","zh":"母亲不喜欢孩子太爱唠叨。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cerewet","ipa":"/tʃərəwɛt/","zh":"爱唠叨的","phrase":{"t":"mulut cerewet","zh":"多嘴的嘴巴"},"example":{"t":"Dia memang cerewet sejak kecil.","zh":"他从小就爱唠叨。"}},{"w":"mencereweti","ipa":"/mənʃərəwɛti/","zh":"对某人唠叨，不断指责某人","phrase":{"t":"mencereweti anak","zh":"对孩子唠叨"},"example":{"t":"Jangan mencereweti dia terus-menerus.","zh":"不要一直对他唠叨个没完。"}},{"w":"kecerewetan","ipa":"/kətʃərəwɛtan/","zh":"唠叨，多嘴（名词化）","phrase":{"t":"karena kecerewetannya","zh":"因为他的唠叨"},"example":{"t":"Semua orang terganggu dengan kecerewetannya.","zh":"大家都对他的唠叨感到厌烦。"}}],"derSlugs":["cerewet","mencereweti","kecerewetan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-30T15:35:29.553Z","src":"base"}